msgid "lowpower.h"
msgstr "lowpower.h"

msgid "Explicit continuous-clock tickless timer port."
msgstr "显式的连续时钟无 tick 定时器端口。"

msgid "Bounded late alarm catch-up; larger delays violate the timer port."
msgstr "有界的延迟闹钟追赶；超出边界即违反定时器端口合同。"

msgid "Return the explicitly selected continuous timer port."
msgstr "返回显式选定的连续定时器端口。"

msgid "Kernel tickless hook with measured phase preservation."
msgstr "保留实测相位的内核无 tick 钩子。"

msgid "Stopped-tick epoch with the concrete port's declared precision."
msgstr "tick 停止 epoch，精度以具体端口声明为准。"

msgid "Caller-owned, immutable tickless timer implementation."
msgstr "调用者拥有的不可变无 tick 定时器实现。"

msgid "All methods run in privileged Idle Thread mode with PRIMASK=1 and scheduler suspended. They are bounded, never block or call kernel functions. pause_tick atomically stops the periodic tick and snapshots elapsed phase in its current tick period; a pending tick is rejected without effects. SUCCESS borrows the timer until resume_tick. now_us is the same monotonic clock as snapshot, continuous during shallow sleep. arm_deadline programs an enabled IRQ wake source; rejection retains no alarm. disarm removes only that alarm. resume_tick restores the periodic source with its next expiry at the supplied absolute clock instant, preserving phase within its declared quantization and sampling bound rather than adding callback latency to every tick. It must not publish an already accounted tick. The alarm wakes by deadline; at most eight extra ticks of latency may be caught up. Reversed clocks or larger latency fail stop. This does not configure clocks, NVIC, SCR or a board timer."
msgstr "全部方法在特权 Idle Thread 模式、PRIMASK=1 且调度器挂起时运行。方法必须有界，不阻塞、不调用内核函数。pause_tick 以原子方式停止周期 tick，并快照当前 tick 周期已经过的相位；若有 pending tick，则无效果地拒绝。SUCCESS 开始借用定时器，直到 resume_tick。now_us 必须与 snapshot 使用同一单调时钟，并在浅睡眠期间连续运行。arm_deadline 配置已启用的 IRQ 唤醒源；拒绝时不得保留闹钟。disarm 仅撤销该闹钟。resume_tick 恢复周期源，下一次到期必须位于所供给的绝对时钟时刻；在已声明量化和采样边界内保持相位，而不是给每个 tick 累加回调延迟。不得发布已经计入的 tick。闹钟必须不晚于截止时间唤醒；至多允许追赶八个额外 tick 的延迟。时钟倒退或更大延迟必须故障停止。本接口不配置时钟、NVIC、SCR 或板级定时器。"

